// dominance of Polish pleases them.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'minority_school_rights');
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_minority_schools');
!}

= Language rights and minority schools

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

The minorities want to teach their children in their own language, and the national democrats want a Polish school. The language rule we choose applies in the whole country.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @own_language
- @agreed_bilingual
- @polish_dominance
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@own_language
title: Introduce teaching in the mother tongue
subtitle: Costs 1 budget unit a month. The minorities trust PPS more (+4), but the national democrats protest, and our relations with them worsen (−5). [+ pl_minority_school_rights_own_language_coalition +]
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'minority_school_rights', 'own_language').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_minority_school_rights_own_language_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'minority_school_rights', 'own_language');
!}
go-to: result

@agreed_bilingual
title: Introduce agreed bilingualism
subtitle: Costs 1 budget unit a month and needs an agreement with a minority club; keeping it improves our relations with that club (+4). The minorities trust us a little more (+2), and the national democrats do not protest.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'minority_school_rights', 'agreed_bilingual').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_minority_school_rights_agreed_bilingual_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'minority_school_rights', 'agreed_bilingual');
!}
go-to: result

@polish_dominance
title: Impose a school with Polish as its language
subtitle: Costs 1 budget unit a month. The national democrats are pleased (+5), but the minorities lose trust (−6); if we made agreements with them, we break them. [+ pl_minority_school_rights_polish_dominance_coalition +]
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'minority_school_rights', 'polish_dominance').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_minority_school_rights_polish_dominance_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'minority_school_rights', 'polish_dominance');
!}
go-to: result

